<title>UK: MBNA unit prices 750 mln guilder 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>MBNA unit prices 750 mln guilder 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager Morgan Stanley, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MBNA AMERICA/EUROPE STRUCTURED OFFERING NO.1</p>
<p> AMT    750 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    21.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.505   PAY DATE   S22.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.83     SPREAD	+30 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   LISTING    LUX/AMST  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   1.75</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
